            <h1>About Bremray Electrical</h1>
            <p>We install, repair, and update the electrical equipment in your home. We serve Ann Arbor and Washtenaw County.</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="/get-help.html" class="btn btn-primary">Tell us what you need</a>
