    <section class="about-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>Electricians you can talk to</h2>
                <p>We've done electrical work since 1988 and served Ann Arbor since 2004. We're licensed and insured.</p>
                <p>You might know exactly what you want, or you might need help working it out. Tell us what's going on. We'll explain what the job needs and talk through your options.</p>

                <h3>The work we do</h3>
                <p>Most of our work is in people's homes. We install <a href="/ev-charger-installation.html">EV chargers</a>, <a href="/generators.html">backup generators</a>, and <a href="/electrical-panel-upgrade.html">electrical panels</a>. We also add lights, outlets, and circuits, and handle <a href="/residential-electrical.html">repairs and rewiring</a>.</p>
                <p>We do electrical work for spas, hot tubs, and saunas, too. We occasionally work in small stores and schools. <a href="/services.html">See our services →</a></p>

                <h3>Start with the job you have in mind</h3>
                <p>Use the request form to tell us what you want to install or what isn't working. You can choose from the buttons or type it in your own words. We'll follow up to discuss the work and what happens next.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

